{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvanqCM8jwuRC2pvrTP8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: default to sunsetting the integration. Rebuild only if the four accounts, or the deals that depend on it, justify about 30 engineer-days.**\n\n**The numbers**\n- Four of 3,100 accounts is 0.13%.\n- The \"2 days a month\" maintenance cost stops mattering in five months, because the old API dies. The real choice is rebuild (about 30 engineer-days, plus ongoing upkeep of the new API) against sunset.\n- Maintenance until shutdown is only about 10 days, so it doesn't argue for rebuilding.\n\n**Interviews alone won't decide this**\nFour customers will say they'd like to keep it. That tells you little about whether it's worth 30 days. The decision depends on three things:\n1. **Revenue at stake.** What is the ARR of the four accounts, and are any strategic or at renewal? Could 30 engineer-days buy more retention or growth elsewhere?\n2. **Substitutes.** Do they have a supported alternative, such as a generic SMTP, Gmail or Outlook integration, that covers their workflow?\n3. **Hidden demand.** Is the integration cited in sales deals or on pricing pages? Is usage trending up or down?\n\n**Next step (about 3–5 days, with a decision date)**\n- Pull the data above. This is internal work and needs no outreach.\n- Hold short calls with the four accounts, framed around \"how do you use it, and what would migrating cost you?\" rather than \"should we rebuild?\"\n- Decide within about 4 weeks. A 6-week build plus buffer needs a start by roughly month 2 of the 5.\n\n**Decision rule:** rebuild only if the revenue at risk clearly exceeds the cost of 30 engineer-days, or if the integration is strategically important. Otherwise, announce the sunset and give those accounts a migration path."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3454,"cache_read_input_tokens":5019,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3454},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd2b308b-3314-4eec-abae-94d3dd9ce6ca","uuid":"c4431d1a-9656-4491-9d6a-662207cb423d","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:10:12.404Z","request_id":"req_011CfvanpvE9RHXYo9ACTh4s"}
